WEBVTT

00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:22.775
Tell me
nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me
I don't understand anything, but

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:29.945
You say
itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say
those kinds of words, too

00:00:30.895 --> 00:00:37.695
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:44.835
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:50.665
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:50.945 --> 00:00:54.385
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:59.175
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.455 --> 00:01:05.015
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.225 --> 00:01:08.755
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.565 --> 00:01:14.335
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:34.785
Footsteps of Collapse

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:40.185
Shugo...

00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:43.325
I'm alright.

00:01:44.435 --> 00:01:46.365
I have no idea where "here" is.

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:48.225
But...

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:51.165
I'm alive.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.505
Big brother.

00:01:55.275 --> 00:01:56.435
Rena!

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.185
Just a regular user, huh?

00:02:12.595 --> 00:02:15.995
That might be... Interesting.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.035
You will be taken into custody for...

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.705
...the illegal modification
of your costume.

00:02:28.145 --> 00:02:30.505
Nooo!

00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:34.675
Exposing illegal players
is going smoothly.

00:02:35.185 --> 00:02:36.045
However.

00:02:36.385 --> 00:02:39.045
Kite and the modified
monsters haven't yet...

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:41.855
Find them, no matter what.

00:02:42.355 --> 00:02:44.955
We can't let that illegal Kite character...

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.985
...roam around free.

00:02:48.165 --> 00:02:49.235
Yes!

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:50.565
Where are you, Kite?

00:02:51.105 --> 00:02:54.965
No, the illegal player
character who can Data Drain.

00:03:00.975 --> 00:03:03.065
Man. They're everywhere...

00:03:03.175 --> 00:03:04.975
...streets are full of Cerulean Knights.

00:03:05.345 --> 00:03:08.905
There's no way we can
get to a Chaos Gate.

00:03:09.015 --> 00:03:10.145
Darn it!

00:03:10.615 --> 00:03:11.775
Got it Shugo?

00:03:11.855 --> 00:03:13.915
Even when moving, don't get careless.

00:03:14.495 --> 00:03:17.185
Do everything you can to
keep from standing out.

00:03:18.165 --> 00:03:19.715
In this get-up?!

00:03:19.965 --> 00:03:22.895
What! This is really rare stuff!

00:03:23.335 --> 00:03:26.025
Be grateful that I'm lending it to you!

00:03:26.735 --> 00:03:29.165
Don't you have something
just a little simpler?

00:03:29.435 --> 00:03:30.405
Just a little?

00:03:31.075 --> 00:03:32.375
Don't be so picky.

00:03:32.805 --> 00:03:36.745
Anything is better than
looking like Kite, right?

00:03:36.775 --> 00:03:38.305
That's true but...

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:42.175
Hey, you suspicious
characters over there!!

00:03:45.655 --> 00:03:47.285
N-no way.

00:03:47.585 --> 00:03:50.955
We're just a frog and a
rabbit, passing through.

00:03:50.995 --> 00:03:54.125
That's right, we're
not at all suspicious.

00:03:54.935 --> 00:03:57.265
Those sounds you made
were especially suspicious.

00:04:00.565 --> 00:04:04.935
You look like the
wanted character, Kite.

00:04:05.205 --> 00:04:06.295
He certainly does.

00:04:06.705 --> 00:04:09.875
Hey, you guys, come
here for a moment!

00:04:10.275 --> 00:04:12.775
Ah! An illegal flying
Chinese Peach Tofu.

00:04:21.455 --> 00:04:21.895
Shugo, this way!

00:04:21.895 --> 00:04:22.595
Wait!
Shugo, this way!

00:04:23.055 --> 00:04:24.545
Over there! Don't let them get away!

00:04:32.965 --> 00:04:36.135
Find them!
They won't have gotten far!

00:04:36.635 --> 00:04:38.265
Divide into two groups
and we'll box them in!

00:04:38.345 --> 00:04:39.325
Yes!

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:43.675
Welcome back.

00:04:45.645 --> 00:04:47.745
To think that there was so much...

00:04:48.115 --> 00:04:49.705
...space beneath that
grungy dog house.

00:04:51.255 --> 00:04:53.415
So, did you find anything?

00:04:53.685 --> 00:04:55.785
Don't even start with that.

00:04:55.855 --> 00:04:58.415
It's nearly impossible
to walk in the city.

00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:00.855
At least with Shugo.

00:05:11.305 --> 00:05:13.435
So, no one has any clues?

00:05:14.205 --> 00:05:15.305
I wonder where Rena...

00:05:15.345 --> 00:05:17.075
...could have sent the mail from.

00:05:17.315 --> 00:05:18.375
Even if we tried to search for her...

00:05:18.585 --> 00:05:20.275
...it's crawling with knights outside.

00:05:21.355 --> 00:05:23.145
There's no other way?

00:05:23.755 --> 00:05:25.245
Maybe there is?

00:05:27.385 --> 00:05:28.515
You!

00:05:29.955 --> 00:05:31.945
Balmung's flunky!

00:05:32.525 --> 00:05:35.795
Wrong, wrong.
He's Kamui's love right now.

00:05:36.465 --> 00:05:38.295
Can't you call me something else!?

00:05:51.485 --> 00:05:52.705
There has to be...

00:05:54.545 --> 00:05:58.005
There just has to be
an exit somewhere.

00:06:13.805 --> 00:06:15.775
Looks like they're still at it.

00:06:16.405 --> 00:06:17.635
Not to mention...

00:06:17.735 --> 00:06:19.735
...it's getting more intense.

00:06:23.215 --> 00:06:24.505
How annoying.

00:06:24.745 --> 00:06:26.335
With security this tight...

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:28.075
...we can't play with
Shugo and the others.

00:06:28.585 --> 00:06:29.915
It can't be helped.

00:06:30.555 --> 00:06:32.345
We just have to lay low for now.

00:06:32.855 --> 00:06:34.545
Firing off big fireworks...

00:06:34.825 --> 00:06:37.055
...requires certain preparations.

00:06:37.725 --> 00:06:39.195
Speaking of which, where's Hayato?

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:40.615
Don't you know?

00:06:40.725 --> 00:06:41.695
What?

00:06:41.765 --> 00:06:44.995
It seems he got a new PC recently.

00:06:45.665 --> 00:06:47.825
He's been playing by
himself, here and there.

00:06:55.145 --> 00:06:57.835
This place gives me the creeps.

00:06:58.085 --> 00:07:01.485
I've heard that the
monsters here are tough.

00:07:01.585 --> 00:07:02.515
If we can defeat one...

00:07:02.715 --> 00:07:04.705
...we can level up immediately.

00:07:04.955 --> 00:07:06.215
Let's do it, let's do it.

00:07:07.585 --> 00:07:10.645
Like moths to a flame.

00:07:11.155 --> 00:07:12.925
It's your fault...

00:07:13.525 --> 00:07:16.325
To appear before me
at a time like this!

00:07:22.935 --> 00:07:23.595
Get them!

00:07:29.875 --> 00:07:32.345
Team A, capture the monster.

00:07:32.415 --> 00:07:34.975
The rest of you search
every inch of the area!

00:07:35.255 --> 00:07:37.115
Don't let even an ant escape!

00:07:42.025 --> 00:07:42.955
Got it!

00:07:43.025 --> 00:07:44.045
One person...

00:07:44.155 --> 00:07:45.285
...doing a quick
teleport from this area.

00:07:45.695 --> 00:07:47.425
Continue the trace!

00:07:47.765 --> 00:07:49.235
Don't let them get away!

00:07:50.165 --> 00:07:51.325
Kamui!

00:07:51.435 --> 00:07:52.495
Did you find them?!

00:07:52.535 --> 00:07:54.395
It's not Kite...

00:07:54.705 --> 00:07:56.195
...it's the ones that
modified the monsters.

00:07:57.035 --> 00:07:58.165
We've hit the jackpot!

00:07:58.375 --> 00:07:59.635
We let him escape and...

00:07:59.775 --> 00:08:02.075
...are waiting for him to
contact his associates!

00:08:03.145 --> 00:08:05.135
So they've finally shown themselves.

00:08:05.385 --> 00:08:06.505
Yes.

00:08:17.295 --> 00:08:18.655
This is?

00:08:19.695 --> 00:08:20.825
A server?

00:08:21.265 --> 00:08:21.855
Yeah.

00:08:22.065 --> 00:08:24.625
Sorry, I used my
system administrator...

00:08:24.805 --> 00:08:26.465
...powers to look into it on my own.

00:08:27.205 --> 00:08:28.795
That's where Rena sent the mail from.

00:08:29.505 --> 00:08:31.905
So then...
You know where Rena is now?

00:08:31.905 --> 00:08:33.275
How can we trust what he says...

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:35.805
...he's with Kamui!

00:08:35.915 --> 00:08:37.745
Trust me or not, it's your choice...

00:08:38.015 --> 00:08:39.245
...but do you have any other clues?

00:08:41.715 --> 00:08:42.805
So...

00:08:43.785 --> 00:08:45.985
I don't know all the details...

00:08:46.285 --> 00:08:48.955
...but it's an unopened server.

00:08:49.125 --> 00:08:51.315
The area is still under construction.

00:08:51.595 --> 00:08:52.895
What did you say?

00:08:52.925 --> 00:08:53.825
And that's why...

00:08:53.925 --> 00:08:56.055
...we couldn't find her no
matter where we searched.

00:08:56.465 --> 00:08:57.725
What do you mean?

00:08:57.995 --> 00:08:58.555
In other words.

00:08:58.935 --> 00:09:01.025
It's like a store before
it's been opened.

00:09:01.435 --> 00:09:03.665
Only those affiliated with it can enter.

00:09:04.305 --> 00:09:07.005
So is the perpetrator involved
with CC Corporation?

00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:08.505
Not at all.

00:09:08.815 --> 00:09:12.075
Based on the series of
incidents, there's no doubt...

00:09:12.185 --> 00:09:13.545
...it's a crime done by an outsider.

00:09:13.685 --> 00:09:14.875
Then...

00:09:14.985 --> 00:09:16.315
From what I've figured...

00:09:16.515 --> 00:09:17.645
...we're dealing with a skilled hacker...

00:09:17.955 --> 00:09:21.515
...who can enter a server
before it's been opened.

00:09:22.055 --> 00:09:23.285
There's no way for a normal...

00:09:23.795 --> 00:09:26.025
...person to get through that barrier.

00:09:26.865 --> 00:09:27.985
Wait a minute!

00:09:28.095 --> 00:09:28.685
Then...

00:09:28.935 --> 00:09:31.595
There's no way for us
to get there, either?

00:09:31.935 --> 00:09:33.055
I wonder?

00:09:34.165 --> 00:09:35.865
There is a way, isn't there.

00:09:36.205 --> 00:09:38.175
Right, Sanjuro?

00:09:39.305 --> 00:09:40.775
Gate Hacking.

00:09:41.575 --> 00:09:44.475
Another of the bracelet's abilities.

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:51.685
This is a list of areas in the server.

00:09:53.455 --> 00:09:56.015
So Rena is somewhere... in here?!

00:09:56.495 --> 00:09:58.395
Definitely. And the culprits as well.

00:10:00.365 --> 00:10:01.695
Well then, I'll be going now.

00:10:02.565 --> 00:10:04.395
Wait! How?

00:10:06.835 --> 00:10:07.495
"How"?

00:10:07.905 --> 00:10:09.965
How did you know
where our hideout was?!

00:10:10.305 --> 00:10:12.205
How can someone who
betrayed Balmung...

00:10:12.405 --> 00:10:13.465
...be helping us?!

00:10:15.245 --> 00:10:16.765
I don't know. Bye.

00:10:24.255 --> 00:10:25.485
It's mail from Hayato.

00:10:26.655 --> 00:10:28.485
Looks like he's been found.

00:10:29.025 --> 00:10:30.185
What should we do?

00:10:30.295 --> 00:10:32.155
Should we just run?

00:10:32.595 --> 00:10:33.825
What are you saying?

00:10:34.265 --> 00:10:36.595
When they check the
access logs, it will be over.

00:10:36.995 --> 00:10:38.155
No way.

00:10:38.505 --> 00:10:39.525
Let's go.

00:10:42.105 --> 00:10:43.335
Everything's going according to plan.

00:10:44.335 --> 00:10:44.375
Wait a minute!

00:10:44.375 --> 00:10:45.965
Let's go! Everyone!
Wait a minute!

00:10:48.245 --> 00:10:49.405
If you go out like this...

00:10:49.545 --> 00:10:51.235
...we'll just end up repeating it all!

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:53.915
And there'll probably be Cerulean...

00:10:54.245 --> 00:10:56.775
...Knights ready and
waiting in front of the gate.

00:10:57.115 --> 00:10:58.345
So, what about it?!

00:10:59.585 --> 00:11:03.685
Um... I have an idea.

00:11:05.865 --> 00:11:07.325
Tres Bien!

00:11:09.635 --> 00:11:12.155
Just as I thought, I'm so beautiful!

00:11:14.005 --> 00:11:17.405
Um... I have a present for you.

00:11:20.345 --> 00:11:23.175
My rare item!

00:11:24.575 --> 00:11:26.605
Tres Bien!

00:11:27.045 --> 00:11:29.535
There he is! The Kite Player Character!

00:11:29.815 --> 00:11:31.585
Why is this happening!

00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:34.525
What did I do wrong?

00:11:35.025 --> 00:11:37.655
I hate frogs now.

00:11:46.535 --> 00:11:47.765
You're...

00:11:49.805 --> 00:11:50.965
Shugo!

00:11:51.305 --> 00:11:52.035
At any rate...

00:11:52.245 --> 00:11:54.295
...let's check all the areas on this list!

00:11:55.545 --> 00:11:58.345
"Dying Destroyer's Grave"!

00:12:00.085 --> 00:12:00.475
Huh!?

00:12:05.655 --> 00:12:06.715
Idiot!

00:12:06.885 --> 00:12:09.585
The bracelet!
Use the power of the bracelet!

00:12:10.525 --> 00:12:11.585
I see...

00:12:12.425 --> 00:12:13.515
I'm counting on you!

00:12:15.495 --> 00:12:18.695
"Dying Destroyer's Grave"!

00:12:51.065 --> 00:12:52.195
This is...

00:12:52.905 --> 00:12:54.195
Don't let your guard down.

00:12:55.005 --> 00:12:55.765
That's...

00:12:58.975 --> 00:13:01.105
Shugo! What's he doing here?

00:13:01.375 --> 00:13:02.775
This was not planned.

00:13:03.015 --> 00:13:05.345
That's fine, we can
just destroy them all.

00:13:05.685 --> 00:13:08.345
These people, what do they...

00:13:08.415 --> 00:13:10.245
Don't be fooled by their appearance!

00:13:10.555 --> 00:13:12.485
These are the masterminds
behind the incidents.

00:13:12.655 --> 00:13:14.715
Masterminds? Then they're...

00:13:16.955 --> 00:13:17.825
Shugo.

00:13:19.165 --> 00:13:20.785
Where are you hiding Rena?

00:13:21.025 --> 00:13:23.585
Oh dear, he's gotten all worked up.

00:13:23.765 --> 00:13:24.995
Wait a moment.

00:13:25.135 --> 00:13:27.225
The group will be here soon.

00:13:27.765 --> 00:13:29.935
Then we can deal with you.

00:13:30.035 --> 00:13:32.135
Group? What's that?

00:13:32.605 --> 00:13:33.235
Who knows?

00:13:34.275 --> 00:13:35.435
Don't toy with us!

00:13:35.645 --> 00:13:37.545
You guys, quit playing around!

00:13:38.415 --> 00:13:40.275
What are you saying, Shugo?

00:13:40.815 --> 00:13:42.285
This is a game.

00:13:42.555 --> 00:13:43.745
That's right...

00:13:43.985 --> 00:13:46.385
...what's wrong with playing a game?

00:13:53.025 --> 00:13:54.425
Then...

00:13:55.265 --> 00:13:57.165
...I'll end this game.

00:13:57.835 --> 00:13:58.925
Forever!

00:14:08.745 --> 00:14:10.375
We've been waiting.

00:14:11.915 --> 00:14:13.605
The Cerulean Knights!

00:14:15.255 --> 00:14:17.275
The Kite player character.

00:14:17.955 --> 00:14:19.945
So you are in league with them.

00:14:21.185 --> 00:14:22.715
I'll destroy all of you!

00:14:23.055 --> 00:14:24.685
All members, attack!

00:14:30.765 --> 00:14:34.225
Man, there's no reason
to get so worked up.

00:14:34.905 --> 00:14:37.495
You'll get burned if you
don't keep a cool head.

00:14:41.705 --> 00:14:42.765
Those are...

00:14:42.875 --> 00:14:44.075
Modified monsters!

00:14:44.315 --> 00:14:45.005
Fools.

00:14:45.215 --> 00:14:48.085
Did you think a toy
like that could hurt us?

00:14:48.655 --> 00:14:50.375
Formation Delta!

00:14:59.965 --> 00:15:01.485
What? It countered the attack.

00:15:01.795 --> 00:15:02.785
Didn't you know?

00:15:02.865 --> 00:15:04.955
Their skills advance by the day.

00:15:05.565 --> 00:15:08.625
An old tool like that
has no effect anymore.

00:15:08.935 --> 00:15:10.425
That's right. That's right!

00:15:15.245 --> 00:15:16.405
That sound?!

00:15:21.985 --> 00:15:23.285
Don't falter!

00:15:23.515 --> 00:15:25.315
In the name of the Cerulean Knights!

00:15:25.685 --> 00:15:28.085
Annihilate everyone who
disobeys the rules!!

00:15:30.655 --> 00:15:32.925
It's impossible!
Weapons have no affect!

00:15:33.225 --> 00:15:34.855
How do you plan on fighting it?

00:15:35.595 --> 00:15:37.085
Leave it to me!

00:15:41.765 --> 00:15:44.535
Your opponent... is me!

00:16:08.025 --> 00:16:09.155
Stop it!!

00:16:09.295 --> 00:16:12.195
We shouldn't be fighting
each other now!

00:16:12.765 --> 00:16:13.565
We have to do...

00:16:13.905 --> 00:16:16.265
...something about those
modified monsters!

00:16:16.805 --> 00:16:18.705
Don't worry.

00:16:18.775 --> 00:16:20.905
That's OUR job!

00:16:21.645 --> 00:16:24.075
I'll delete all of you!

00:16:27.785 --> 00:16:29.305
Just as planned.

00:16:29.555 --> 00:16:32.645
Yeah. She's keeping
Shugo back for us.

00:16:33.355 --> 00:16:35.345
If we can destroy all of them...

00:16:35.395 --> 00:16:37.155
...there'll be no one in our way.

00:16:37.355 --> 00:16:38.055
Yeah.

00:16:38.795 --> 00:16:40.525
Then this world...

00:16:56.645 --> 00:16:58.375
W-What's wrong?

00:17:00.215 --> 00:17:01.545
The monsters have...

00:17:02.685 --> 00:17:03.985
...disappeared.

00:17:15.195 --> 00:17:16.265
W-what?!

00:17:16.265 --> 00:17:18.355
I've never seen a character like that.

00:17:18.865 --> 00:17:20.165
Please!

00:17:20.505 --> 00:17:23.665
Delete everything so
there's no evidence.

00:17:27.905 --> 00:17:30.605
That's... a wandering Al!

00:17:31.075 --> 00:17:32.475
Wandering Al?

00:17:33.115 --> 00:17:35.745
Wandering... Al?

00:17:56.335 --> 00:17:57.495
That's...

00:18:01.705 --> 00:18:02.975
The area...

00:18:04.215 --> 00:18:05.775
...is disappearing.

00:18:12.255 --> 00:18:13.485
Run!

00:18:14.055 --> 00:18:16.185
We have to get away from the area!

00:18:17.595 --> 00:18:18.955
Run?

00:18:19.825 --> 00:18:20.985
I won't let you.

00:18:24.695 --> 00:18:26.035
I can't teleport!

00:18:26.465 --> 00:18:27.555
A protection?!

00:18:28.005 --> 00:18:29.025
No way.

00:18:29.105 --> 00:18:30.535
Everyone will die.

00:18:32.705 --> 00:18:33.735
Let's go.

00:18:33.775 --> 00:18:35.245
We'll leave this to her.

00:18:38.475 --> 00:18:40.705
Hey! What's going on?

00:18:40.985 --> 00:18:42.885
CC Corporation protection?!

00:18:43.315 --> 00:18:44.545
No, it's not.

00:18:45.285 --> 00:18:46.415
This is...

00:18:53.865 --> 00:18:55.025
W-What's this?

00:19:11.345 --> 00:19:12.605
